note What one id learned last frame, and the answer open gives back: hovered is 'it was the hit', clicked is that plus a left press this frame, double_clicked that plus a double click, down is that it is active and the button is still down, drag is the pointer movement since last frame while it is active (never on the press frame itself), wheel and pinch are the wheel and pinch only while hovered, and rect is where it was last frame. Callable without creating an element, for a caller that needs to know it is hovered in order to decide what the element should look like.

